{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49063","headline":"游倚帝山二首 一 · 吴筠","name":"游倚帝山二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山间非吾心，物表翼所托。\n振衣超烦滓，策杖追岑壑。\n绝地穷㟏岈，造天究磐礴。\n迩临烟霞积，逖睇宇宙廓。\n俯惊白云涌，仰骇飞泉落。\n苔浓鲜翠屏，松古丽丹崿。\n目冀覩乔羡，心希驭龙鹤。\n乃知巢由情，岂伊猨鸟乐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49063.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49063","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}